table synth1 770 4806 256 ; Synth 1
field waveform ~0 u8 0 255 ; Waveform
field tune ~1 u8 0 100 ; Tune (50=0)
field osc ~2 u8 0 255 ; Oscillator
field osc1 ~3 u8 0 127 ; Osc Edit 1
field osc2 ~4 u8 0 127 ; Osc Edit 2
field glide ~5 u8 0 127 ; Glide
field filtertype ~6 u8 0 3 ; Filter Type
field cutoff ~7 u8 0 127 ; Cutoff
field reso ~8 u8 0 127 ; Resonance
field egint ~9 u8 0 127 ; EG Int (64=0)
field drive ~10 u8 0 127 ; Drive
field level ~11 u8 0 127 ; Level
field pan ~12 u8 0 127 ; Pan (64=Center)
field egtime ~13 u8 0 127 ; EG Time
field fxselect ~14 u8 @0:2 0 2 ; FX Select (0=FX1..2=FX3)
field fxsend ~14 u8 @2:1 0=Off 1=On ; FX Send
field roll ~14 u8 @3:1 0=Off 1=On ; Roll
field ampeg ~14 u8 @4:1 0=Gate 1=EG ; Amp EG
field modspeed ~17 u8 0 127 ; Mod Speed
field moddepth ~18 u8 0 127 ; Mod Depth

